OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch's claim that a Tory
OL,8,Fadviser and former antisemite was
OL,9,Fcertified by the Government to give
OL,10,Fcounter-extremism training has been
OL,11,Fcontradicted by the Home Office.
OL,13,FJoshua Bonehill-Paine has been given a
OL,14,Frole working with the Conservatives on
OL,15,Ftackling radicalisation after
OL,16,Fwithdrawing as a local election
OL,17,Fcandidate for Somerset Council over a
OL,18,Fbacklash against his selection.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FTory leader Mrs Badenoch has defended
OL,8,Fhim by insisting he has been
OL,9,Frehabilitated since his convictions
OL,10,Ffor harassing a Jewish politician and
OL,11,Fproducing an advert for a neo-Nazi
OL,12,Frally.
OL,14,FEarlier this week, she told reporters
OL,15,FMr Bonehill-Paine had since "been
OL,16,Fcertified by the Home Office to train
OL,17,Fpolice officers on antisemitism and on
OL,18,Fcountering extremism".
OL,26,@wD@]OUzD@UO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FBut in a statement, the department
OL,8,Fsaid: "The Home Office does not
OL,9,Fcertify individuals to deliver
OL,10,Ftraining.
OL,12,F"We do provide funding to civil
OL,13,Fsociety organisations, who may use
OL,14,Findividuals to deliver training on
OL,15,Fpreventing extremism that is
OL,16,Fcommissioned by local authorities."
OL,26,@pD@GOUtD@AOUxD@cO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
