FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FMr Bonehill-Paine was convicted in
OL,8,F2016 of racially aggravated harassment
OL,9,Fagainst Labour peer Baroness Luciana
OL,10,FBerger, who is Jewish and was then MP
OL,11,Ffor Liverpool Wavertree.
OL,13,FHe wrote several blog posts about her,
OL,14,Fdescribing her as "an evil money-
OL,15,Fgrabber" with a "deep-rooted hatred of
OL,16,Fmen".
OL,18,FIn one post, he claimed the number of
OL,19,FJewish Labour MPs was a "problem".
OL,26,@vD@SOUwD@HO]wD@QOUxD@DO]{D@YOU{D@aO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FHe was previously jailed for producing
OL,8,Fan advert illustrated with a picture
OL,9,Fof Nazi concentration camp Auschwitz
OL,10,Fwhich promised "an absolute gas" at a
OL,11,Frally in Golders Green, north London.
OL,13,FEarlier this week, Mr Bonehill-Paine
OL,14,Fsaid he had "no excuses" for his
OL,15,Fprevious offending, and added he has
OL,16,Fsince dedicated himself to
OL,17,F"challenging the wave of hatred
OL,18,FBritish Jews continue to face".
OL,26,@rD@POUrD@`O]vD@MOUvD@XO]yD@AOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FBut the Tories faced a backlash from
OL,8,FJewish groups and political opponents
OL,9,Fover the decision to select him to
OL,10,Ffight the new Somerset Council seat of
OL,11,FCrewkerne South next year, with
OL,12,Fcritics arguing his past convictions
OL,13,Fmake him unfit for a role in public
OL,14,Flife.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FAfter withdrawing his candidacy, Mr
OL,8,FBonehill-Paine said he had been
OL,9,Foffered a position as an adviser to
OL,10,Fthe Conservatives' culture and
OL,11,Fintegration commission "specifically
OL,12,Ffocusing on how young men become
OL,13,Fradicalised".
OL,15,FLady Berger said the new decision was
OL,16,Fan "insult", while Foreign Secretary
OL,17,FEd Miliband said the Tories had
OL,18,Fquestions to answer over any
OL,19,Factivities he undertakes on behalf of
OL,20,Fthe party.
OL,26,@sD@XOUuD@LO]xD@DOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Sir Ed Davey
OL,8,Fsaid Mrs Badenoch had shown an
OL,9,F"outrageous lack of judgment, doubling
OL,10,Fdown on her support for a former neo-
OL,11,FNazi".
OL,13,FA Reform UK spokesman said Mr Bonehill-
OL,14,FPaine's appointment "beggars belief".
OL,16,FBut Phil Rosenberg, president of the
OL,17,FBoard of Deputies of British Jews,
OL,18,Fsaid it was a positive move.
OL,26,@qD@AOUsD@EO]vD@UOUvD@dO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FMr Rosenberg, who previously declined
OL,8,Fan offer from the Conservatives to
OL,9,Fmeet the would-be councillor, said the
OL,10,Frole would be more appropriate than
OL,11,Fhim standing as a local politician.
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, Mrs Badenoch said she
OL,14,Fwas "sad" Mr Bonehill-Paine "won't be
OL,15,Fgiven the space to explain his
OL,16,Fposition and represent his community".
OL,26,@vD@EOUvD@IO]vD@]OUxD@eO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/10
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
