OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,410,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40910
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F409A1786126702
OL,3,CEx-antisemite Tory adviser not
OL,4,CGovernment-certified for anti-
OL,5,Cextremism training
OL,7,FShe said: "If we are going to stop
OL,8,Fextremism and antisemitism we are
OL,9,Fgoing to need help from those people
OL,10,Fwho were part of the problem, but have
OL,11,Fnow changed and are being part of the
OL,12,Fsolution.
OL,14,F"Piling on them and trying to get them
OL,15,Fcancelled may be sport for other
OL,16,Fparties, but this is a different
OL,17,FConservative Party."
OL,26,@oD@KOUvD@AOUyD@TO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G10/10
